---
description: >-
  Regression test for issue #6593: BT gitGraph with explicit branch `order` values (develop order
  3, release/1.0.0 order 2 branched from develop) where release/1.0.0 is merged into main,
  checking that branch column ordering and merge-line routing from a right-positioned branch are
  correct.
---
gitGraph BT:
  commit id: "A"
  branch develop order: 3
  checkout develop
  commit id: "B"
  branch release/1.0.0 order: 2
  checkout release/1.0.0
  commit id: "C"
  commit id: "D"
  checkout main
  merge release/1.0.0 tag: "v1.0.0"
  checkout develop
